#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that bypass all protocols belonging to a selected category."
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match application protocols or services detected by nDPI."
msgstr ""
"Regeln erstellen, die Anwendungsprotokolle oder Dienste zuordnen, die von "
"nDPI erkannt werden."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Create rules that match destination IP addresses or networks directly."
msgstr "Regeln erstellen, die Ziel-IP-Adressen oder Netzwerke direkt zuordnen."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match destination domain names. Domain-based bypass "
"requires OpenMPTCProuter DNS to be used by clients."
msgstr ""
"Regeln erstellen, die Ziel-Domainnamen zuordnen. Domänenbasierter Bypass "
"erfordert, dass Clients den DNS von OpenMPTCProuter verwenden."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match destination ports, for example to steer selected "
"services."
msgstr ""
"Regeln erstellen, die Zielports zuordnen, um zum Beispiel ausgewählte "
"Dienste gezielt zu leiten."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match destinations announced by a specific autonomous "
"system number."
msgstr ""
"Regeln erstellen, die Ziele zuordnen, die von einer bestimmten autonomen "
"Systemnummer angekündigt werden."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match source ports generated by local applications or "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"Regeln erstellen, die Quellports lokaler Anwendungen oder Geräte zuordnen."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match traffic from a local source IP address or subnet."
msgstr ""
"Regeln erstellen, die Datenverkehr von einer lokalen Quell-IP-Adresse oder "
"einem Subnetz zuordnen."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match traffic from specific client devices by MAC address."
msgstr ""
"Regeln erstellen, die Datenverkehr bestimmter Client-Geräte per MAC-Adresse "
"zuordnen."

