#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Ordered list: the first WAN that is up is used, the following ones are the "
"failover order."
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Ordered list: the first interface that is up is used, the next ones take "
"over when it goes down, and the first one is used again once it is back. "
"\"Default\" is the MPTCP master interface; when no listed interface is up, "
"traffic is blocked unless \"Default\" is in the list. Leave empty for no "
"routing change (DSCP marking only)."
msgstr ""

